Package: ppgw-system
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: curimit <curimit@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: ppgw-core, ppgw-geodata, ppgw-dashboard
Description: System integration for PaoPao Gateway
 Turns a stock Ubuntu server into the PaoPao Gateway appliance:
 netplan (DHCP on every ethernet port), sysctl forwarding/tproxy knobs,
 systemd-resolved stub listener off (frees port 53), chrony NTP sources
 reachable from mainland China, and enabling ppgw.service.
 .
 Installing this package reconfigures host networking and DNS. It is the
 top-level entry point of the ppgw package set.
